{"version":1,"content":"<p>「香港網球一哥」黃澤林感情動向再成焦點！</p><p>日前他遠赴韓國出戰ATP首爾挑戰賽，獲新歡「長腿女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）甜蜜隨行。</p><p>好友於今日（2日）上載多張兩人在首爾街頭並肩過馬路的合照，雙方更毫不避嫌地按讚貼文，被指高調將新戀情浮面。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:05.789136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:05:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:11.530930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:11.530930+00:00","content_hash":"eb753f1949af5764bc68394a465d1e38d4585a4c1ade5992ee66a61a0132faa6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}